# Bounded jet-response engineering pilot; NOT a calibrated detector closure.
# Generator particles in reconstructed cones (RecoGen), strict pT>2, both systems at5.36TeV.
# Truth10--40 support is a candidate pending upstream retention evidence.
# Reco below40 is excluded; reported40--80/80--120/120--160; tail through5020 retained.
# Ordinary centrality histogram selection; other activities go to flow, not event filtering.
# Covariance is established within-jet second moments only, not full event covariance.
# No background mixing, pair payload, spectrum weight, angular/energy smear or JER variation.
# The response itself is generator-particle EEC; detector corrections remain pending.
DataType 12
McCorrelationType 1
MatchJets 0
TriggerSelection 0
FilledHistograms 211
JetType 1
JetAxis 1
JetEtaCut 1.6
MinJetPtCut 40
MaxJetPtCut 5020
CutBadPhi 0                # Cut the problematic phi region. 0 = No cut, 1 = crude cut
CutWithEtaCM 0             # Cut jets that are outside of symmetric eta CM acceptance for pPb collisions within the defined jet eta cut in lab frame
MinMaxTrackPtFraction 0.01 # Minimum fraction of jet pT taken by the highest pT track in jet
MaxMaxTrackPtFraction 0.98 # Maximum fraction of jet pT taken by the highest pT track in jet
JetUncertainty 0
Run3JetID 1
ApplyJetVeto 1
JetVetoMapFile jetVetoMaps/ppRef2024/Summer24Prompt24_RunBCDEFGHI.root
JetVetoMapHistogram jetvetomap_all
JetVetoPtConvention stored # Nominal PAT/HiForest jtpt; no extra JES/JER variation
JetVetoInputMinPt 15 # Owner-declared retention bound; complete upstream coverage still requires validation
TrackEtaCut 2.4
MinTrackPtCut 2
MaxTrackPtCut 500
MaxTrackPtRelativeError 0.1 # Maximum relative error allowed for track pT. 0.1 = Nominal, 0.1 = Loose, 0.05 = Tight
VertexMaxDistance 3         # Position with respect to PV resolution. 3 = Nominal, 5 = Loose, 2 = Tight
SubeventCut 2
TrackEfficiencyVariation 0.0 # For tracking uncertainties, vary the efficiency correction by 2.2%
JetPtWeight 0
DisableTrackPairEfficiencyCorrection 1
ZVertexCut 15       # Maximum vz value for accepted tracks
LowPtHatCut -15      # Minimum accepted pT hat
HighPtHatCut 5020      # Maximum accepted pT hat
MultiplicityMode 0 # 0 = Weight MC centrality to match data. 1 = Weight multiplicity to match
JetRadius 0.4
WeightExponent 1
SmearDeltaR 0
SmearEnergyWeight 0
JetPtBinEdgesEEC 10 20 40 80 120 160 200 300 500 5020
TrackPtBinEdgesEEC 0.5 1 1.5 2 2.5 3 3.5 4 300 # Track pT bin edges for EEC
SkipCovarianceMatrix 0
MinJetPtUnfoldingReco 40
MinJetPtUnfoldingTruth 10
CentralityBinEdges -1 100
TrackPtBinEdges     0.7 1 2 3 4 8 12 300                # Track pT binning
PtHatBinEdges       0 30 50 80 120 170 220 280 370 460  # pT hat binning
BackgroundMethods 0
MegaSkimMixing 1 # 0 = If doing mixing, use regular mixing files. 1 = Use megaskimmed mixing files
EventMatchForMixing 1 # 0 = Match HiBin, 1 = Match HF energy, 2 = Match background multiplicity
BinnedMixing 0 # 0 = Match events without bin borders for mixing. 1 = Use binned event matching for mixing
VzMixingBins -0.5 1 # vz binning for mixing
HiBinMixingBins -0.5 1 # HiBin binning for mixing
HFEnergyMixingBins 0 1 # HF energy binning for mixing
MultiplicityMixingBins -0.5 1 # Multiplicity binning for mixing
HFEnergyShift 0
DebugLevel 1
MaxEventsPerFile 10000
ChannelRadiusCode 4
MinPairTrackPt 2
FirstUnfoldedJetPtBin 2
LastUnfoldedJetPtBin 4
